party advertising or analytics cookies. If you later use the Genie product, that service processes the operational data your company connects, including guest messages, tasks, and reservation records, under the instructions of your company."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"How we use it"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"To reply when you email or call us"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To keep the website available and to block abusive traffic"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"To meet a legal obligation, if one applies"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"We do not sell personal information."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Where it is kept"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"Messages you send us are kept for as long as we need them to reply, and then for a short period afterward in case you follow up. You can ask us to delete them sooner. Account information entered at app.talktogenie.ai is handled by that product, not by this marketing site."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Sharing"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"We share personal information with service providers that host this website or help us operate it, and only so they can do that work. We also share it if the law requires it, or to protect Talk to Genie, our users, or someone else from harm. If you become a customer, the systems you choose to connect, such as your PMS or messaging tools, receive only what is needed for those connections."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Your choices"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":"You can ask to see, correct, or delete personal information we hold from a message you sent us. Email support@tal